# Accepted container and dependency findings (ТЗ 1.0.1 §6).
#
# Every line needs a CVE, a date and a reason. An entry without one is not an exception, it is an
# unreviewed vulnerability that happens to be silenced — so this file is deliberately reviewed in
# the same diff as the code that depends on it.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # YYYY-MM-DD reason, and what has to change for the entry to go away
#
# (empty: no exceptions are currently approved)
